  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(2^3\\times2^4=2^{3+4}=2^7=128\\).\n\nAlternative method 1: Evaluate each power first\n\nSince both exponents are small, evaluate each power first: \\(2^3=8\\) and \\(2^4=16\\). Therefore,\n\\[\n2^3\\times2^4=8\\times16=128.\n\\]",
